title: "US Staffing Payroll Compliance Dataset"
abstract: "State-by-state reference data for US staffing and employer-of-record payroll: unemployment insurance (SUTA) wage bases and rates, FUTA credit reductions, minimum wage, pay frequency, final pay deadlines, and workers' compensation basics. Every row cites an official government source and a last-checked date."
